{"id":"n18381-3-7","stage":1,"title":"고치다 · 改正","scene":"考试与改答案","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18381-3-7-1","ko":"삼 번 문제의 답이 이 번이래.","zh":"听说第三题的答案是选项二。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"삼","meaning":"三","explanation":"삼 是数字“三”；与后面的 번 合用，삼 번 문제 指第3题。","readings":[{"term":"삼","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61854","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3"}},{"text":"번","meaning":"号","explanation":"번：号。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"3","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}},{"text":"문제의","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문제의","audio":"/audio/e7a3cece5e61a2404ac0.mp3"}},{"text":"답이","meaning":"答案","explanation":"답：答案；-이 标记主语。这里指第3题的答案。","readings":[{"term":"답","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14003","senseId":"2","lemma":"답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"답이","audio":"/audio/d09f8b157c83a3fab723.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"二","explanation":"이 是数字“二”；与后面的 번 合用，이 번 指2号选项。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71127","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"번이래.","meaning":"号","explanation":"번：号；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；래：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"3","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번이래","audio":"/audio/d33ec2f1cf7954bd6d2c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3cd6c40aac5fd42e","term":"삼","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3","entryId":"61854","definition":"数字三；삼 번 문제 指第3题。","pronunciation":["삼"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"号","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"给某人或某物标的号码。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"题，问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"要求解答的题目。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"9d0673c3b91f0428","term":"답","zh":"答案","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3","entryId":"14003","definition":"对题目所作的正确回答；这里指第3题的正确选项。","pronunciation":["답"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"二","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71127","definition":"数字二；이 번 指2号选项。","pronunciation":["이ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/95d00d73838348a4d34c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18381-3-7-2","ko":"그래? 처음에 4번으로 적었다가 2번으로 고쳤는데 맞았네.","zh":"是吗？我一开始填了4号，后来改成2号，原来答对了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"是吗？","explanation":"그래? 在这里表示对刚听到的答案感到意外，并向对方确认。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"처음에","meaning":"一开始","explanation":"처음：起初、一开始；-에 标记时间。","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처음에","audio":"/audio/3faa7b169ffd37ebdb3b.mp3"}},{"text":"4번으로","meaning":"填成4号","explanation":"4번：4号选项；-으로 表示填写答案时选用的结果。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"3","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"4번으로","audio":"/audio/396552b53902a38f11b4.mp3"}},{"text":"적었다가","meaning":"写下、填了","explanation":"적다：写下、填写；-었다가 表示先填4号，随后又改成2号。","readings":[{"term":"적다","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71234","senseId":"1","lemma":"적다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적었다가","audio":"/audio/cfe3d6d0bb74b70fc2ed.mp3"}},{"text":"2번으로","meaning":"改成2号","explanation":"2번：2号选项；-으로 表示修改后的结果。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"3","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"2번으로","audio":"/audio/ebc8f1d329e531d3093b.mp3"}},{"text":"고쳤는데","meaning":"改正，纠正","explanation":"고치다：改正，纠正；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"고치다","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18381","senseId":"3","lemma":"고치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고쳤는데","audio":"/audio/3f688d8d75c1e5910999.mp3"}},{"text":"맞았네.","meaning":"正确，对","explanation":"맞다：正确，对；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"1","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞았네","audio":"/audio/7a8c2efbf39edb2370bf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"是吗？","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"听到新情况时作出的简短回应，这里带有意外和确认的语气。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"起初、一开始","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在事情开始的时候；这里指最初填写答案时。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"号","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"给某人或某物标的号码。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"5f930febe6cd0f79","term":"적다","zh":"填写、写下","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3","entryId":"71234","definiti